WEBVTT

00:27:54.913 --> 00:28:00.704
the time that one normally should
have to rethink doesn't exist.

00:28:01.079 --> 00:28:03.704
And it's very difficult to be.

00:28:04.788 --> 00:28:10.204
In a healthy way, rethinking
when you are under the gun,

00:28:10.621 --> 00:28:14.496
impractical material and often
very expensive ways.

00:28:14.829 --> 00:28:20.538
For example, when Damon and I started
working on Lost, it was a very particular,

00:28:20.579 --> 00:28:25.454
you know, crazy ticking clock where the
head of ABC at the time, Lloyd Braun,

00:28:25.454 --> 00:28:27.829
wanted a show about people who
survived a plane crash.

00:28:27.829 --> 00:28:33.954
And so in Damini, who had never met,
we wrote that outline.